Sub2API STATE Reuse

This repository contains an independently maintained STATE reuse plugin,
collector and administrator monitor, extracted from an operational integration.
It is not an official OpenAI product or an official Sub2API release.

The vendored plugin/pkg/pluginapi directory comes from the Sub2API plugin SDK
in rw0104/sub2api-cost-console (commit 9b8ee29d0f2b1291be27449f84e14868b9d34c0c),
which derives from Wei-Shaw/sub2api. Upstream license: GNU LGPL version 3.
The original Go module/import namespace is preserved to keep the SDK snapshot
self-contained. The Sub2API host application is not bundled.

See LICENSE (LGPL-3.0) and COPYING (GPL-3.0 terms incorporated by LGPL-3.0).
Local modifications include 292/332 ticket validation, credential-isolated
candidate persistence, runtime/manifest version checks, configurable deployment
settings, collection events and the same-origin administrator monitor.
